                <mxCell id="Fy74xPbGqM9WkFN1T4Cw-343" value="Nasight, Database ERD (PostgreSQL + pgvector, Prisma 7)&#xa;PK = primary key (bold/underline)   FK = foreign key (underline)   UK = unique&#xa;Solid line = ON DELETE CASCADE   Dashed line = ON DELETE SET NULL&#xa;Zones:  blue = Identity   green = Corpus   purple = Conversation   orange = Activity / Metrics&#xa;token_usage &amp; daily_metrics are standalone (no FKs).  report_chunks.embedding = vector(1536) with an HNSW cosine index." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
